✅ Core Idea — Market Is an Auction

Every session rotates through repeatable phases:

BALANCE  →  BREAKOUT  →  ACCEPTANCE  →  CONTINUATION  →  EXHAUSTION
            ↑                                           ↓
            ←────────────── REBALANCE ─────────────────


Your circled trades occur ONLY in:

👉 CONTINUATION phase

So instead of asking:

“Is there a signal?”

Your bot asks:

“What phase is the auction in?”

✅ Phase Definitions (code-able, no new indicators)

We will use only what you already have:

CPR / Pivot levels

EMA structure

ATR

Candle range expansion

Acceptance (close behavior)

1️⃣ BALANCE (Range / Chop)

Market building value.

Characteristics

Price inside CPR

EMA flat

Small ranges

balance =
    bc <= close <= tc and
    abs(ema_fast - ema_slow) < 0.15 * atr


Trade rule:

❌ NO TREND TRADES
✔ mean reversion only

2️⃣ BREAKOUT (Initiative Activity)

Market leaves value.

Characteristics

First strong move outside CPR

Range expansion

