    close > tc and
    candle_range > 1.2 * atr_5m


Trade rule:

⚠ do NOT chase
Wait for acceptance

3️⃣ ACCEPTANCE (Smart Money Confirmation)

Most important phase.

Market proves breakout is real.

Characteristics

Multiple closes outside level

Pullbacks hold

