    last_3_closes.min() > tc


Trade rule:

Prepare for continuation entries

4️⃣ CONTINUATION ⭐ (Your Edge)

Trend becomes efficient.

This is where circled candles live.

Characteristics

Higher highs

Pullbacks respect EMA/value

Momentum re-engages

continuation =
    ema_fast > ema_slow and
    higher_highs and
    pullback_holds


Trade rule:

✅ ENABLE SIGNAL ENGINE

5️⃣ EXHAUSTION

Late buyers trapped.

Characteristics

Large extension from EMA

Momentum divergence

Failed follow-through

exhaustion =
    abs(close - ema_fast) > 2.5 * atr_5m


Trade rule:

❌ STOP TAKING TREND ENTRIES
✔ look for reversals

✅ Phase Engine Implementation
Master classifier
def classify_market_phase(df, cpr, atr):

    c = df.iloc[-1]
    closes = df["close"]

    ema_fast = df["ema_fast"]
    ema_slow = df["ema_slow"]

    tc = cpr["TC"]
    bc = cpr["BC"]

    candle_range = c["high"] - c["low"]
    atr5 = df["atr_5m"].iloc[-1]

    # ----- BALANCE -----
    if bc <= c["close"] <= tc and abs(ema_fast.iloc[-1] - ema_slow.iloc[-1]) < 0.15 * atr:
        return "BALANCE"

    # ----- BREAKOUT -----
    if c["close"] > tc and candle_range > 1.2 * atr5:
        return "BREAKOUT"

    # ----- ACCEPTANCE -----
    if closes.tail(3).min() > tc:
        return "ACCEPTANCE"

    # ----- CONTINUATION -----
    if (
        ema_fast.iloc[-1] > ema_slow.iloc[-1] and
        closes.iloc[-1] > closes.iloc[-3]
    ):
        return "CONTINUATION"

    # ----- EXHAUSTION -----
    if abs(c["close"] - ema_fast.iloc[-1]) > 2.5 * atr5:
        return "EXHAUSTION"

    return "UNKNOWN"

