Core Idea

Each day belongs to an auction regime:

Day Type	        Market Behaviour	            Institutional Action
TREND	            One-directional auction	        Add on continuation
NORMAL	            Balanced expansion	            Trade break + continuation
ROTATIONAL	        Mean reversion	                Fade extremes
COMPRESSION	        Energy build	                Wait for expansion

Your bot must change aggression automatically.

Step 1 — Improve Day Classification

You already have classify_day_type().

Upgrade logic:

def classify_day_type(cpr, daily_atr):

    if daily_atr is None:
        return "UNKNOWN"

    cpr_width = abs(cpr["TC"] - cpr["BC"])

    width_ratio = cpr_width / daily_atr

    if width_ratio < 0.12:
        return "COMPRESSION"

    elif width_ratio < 0.22:
        return "TREND"

    elif width_ratio < 0.35:
        return "NORMAL"

    else:
        return "ROTATIONAL"

Meaning

Small CPR vs ATR ⇒ stored energy ⇒ expansion likely.

Large CPR ⇒ balance ⇒ rotation.

