# 🧠 Institutional Time Participation Model (NSE)

For NIFTY / BANKNIFTY, orderflow statistically clusters into phases:

| Phase                  | Time (IST)  | Institutional Behaviour | What Works        |
| ---------------------- | ----------- | ----------------------- | ----------------- |
| **OPEN DRIVE**         | 09:15–09:45 | Inventory positioning   | Breakouts, sweeps |
| **PRICE DISCOVERY**    | 09:45–11:30 | Trend continuation      | Momentum trades   |
| **MIDDAY DECAY**       | 11:30–13:45 | Algo mean reversion     | Avoid breakouts   |
| **POWER HOUR BUILDUP** | 13:45–14:45 | Position building       | Range expansion   |
| **CLOSING IMBALANCE**  | 14:45–15:30 | Forced hedging          | Strong trends     |

Your strategy must **adapt aggression**, not signals.

