    global inventory_state

    if cpr["BC"] <= price <= cpr["TC"]:
        inventory_state = {
            "bias": "NEUTRAL",
            "strength": 0,
            "trigger_price": None,
            "active": False
        }
```

Return to value → imbalance resolved.

