# 🧠 What is Market Regime (Practically)

For intraday index trading (NIFTY / BANKNIFTY), regimes reduce to:

| Regime                     | Behaviour                     |
| -------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| **TREND DAY**              | Expansion, continuation works |
| **BALANCED DAY**           | Rotations around pivot        |
| **MEAN REVERSION**         | Breakouts fail                |
| **VOLATILE LIQUIDITY DAY** | Sweeps + reversals            |
| **LOW PARTICIPATION**      | Dead market                   |

Your engines already detect pieces — now we unify them.

