# ==========================================================

The **Risk Expansion / Volatility Release Engine** is the layer that tells your system:

> ❝ The market is transitioning from compression → expansion.
> The next move is statistically *larger than normal*. ❞

This is **not momentum**.
This is **stored energy release** — the phase institutions wait for.

You already hinted at this earlier when you stored:

* CPR compression
* Narrow ranges
